abstract: "UltraLink — JavaScript/Node knowledge-graph framework for entities, typed relationships, and temporal versioning, with vector embeddings for semantic similarity. Exports one graph to JSON, GraphML, CSV, Obsidian markdown, interactive D3.js sites, and a compressed full-blob format. MIT, on npm."
